sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 下麦用户
    participant Client as 客户端
    participant Backend as 业务后端
    participant Centrifugo as Centrifugo
    participant LiveKit as LiveKit
    participant Others as 房间内其他成员

    User->>Client: 点击"下麦"
    Client->>Backend: POST /api/voice/leave {group_id}

    alt 临时静音（推荐，保留在房间内）
        Client->>LiveKit: track.mute() / setMicrophoneEnabled(false)
        LiveKit->>Others: TrackMuted 事件
        Others->>Others: 停止播放该用户音频<br/>（订阅关系保留）
    else 彻底下麦（离开语音频道）
        Client->>LiveKit: track.unpublish() / room.disconnect()
        LiveKit->>Others: ParticipantUpdate: 轨道已移除
        Others->>Others: 移除该用户音频轨道
    end

    Note over Backend, Others: 信令同步（Centrifugo）
    Backend->>Centrifugo: HTTP API 发布"用户A下麦"到 group:#ID:signal
    Centrifugo-->>Others: WebSocket 推送信令消息
    Others->>Others: 更新 UI（移除麦克风图标等）

    Backend-->>Client: 确认下麦